{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE DOWNLOAD LINK FOR THE DEMO IS ABOVE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sixth Force is a two-player chaos co-op adventure where the mysterious Sixth Force literally tethers you together. That glowing bond extends into energy whips - superpower and troublemaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/0623b88d204c366721e9da31a21cb679.poster.avif?t=1773072367\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/0623b88d204c366721e9da31a21cb679.webm?t=1773072367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/0623b88d204c366721e9da31a21cb679.mp4?t=1773072367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide along rails; grapple and swing from anything that flies\u2014yes, even penguins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag donuts through rocking lollipops; haul a car through the woods; yank a frog from the bog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight sugar-mad marshmallows and other odd creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge giant forks, knives and mischievous waffles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins and bonbons to feed the Greedy Mouth and push farther.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/627739f935cf32eb06e105e4aeef0516.poster.avif?t=1773072367\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/627739f935cf32eb06e105e4aeef0516.webm?t=1773072367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/627739f935cf32eb06e105e4aeef0516.mp4?t=1773072367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMPORTANT NOTES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 One or two controllers required. Sixth Force is designed as a co-op experience, but a single-player mode is available so you can get a feel for it and share it with a friend later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Shared-screen local &amp; online co-op. Whether you\u2019re playing side by side or via Steam Remote Play Together, the shared-screen setup keeps both players fully in sync and in the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Demo preview of the full game. Play through the tutorial and two levels to get a taste of the world, mechanics, and atmosphere of Sixth Force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist and follow Sixth Force to be among the first to play the full adventure when it\u2019s released!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1773072367\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1773072367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1773072367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2830090?t=1773072367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/c0849005ef5f1c749d119165cdc6765b3e1d88d7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773072367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor